  m_Name: Carta_ManutencaoPreditivaComIA
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Manuten\xE7\xE3o Preditiva com IA"
  _titleEn: AI Predictive Maintenance
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Sensores medem vibra\xE7\xE3o, temperatura e desgaste, e algoritmos
    avisam antes de uma bomba, ponte ou trem falhar."
  _summaryEn: Sensors measure vibration, temperature and wear, and algorithms warn
    before a pump, bridge or train fails.
  _realWorld: "A manuten\xE7\xE3o preditiva j\xE1 \xE9 comum em ferrovias, avia\xE7\xE3o
    e redes de \xE1gua, e pesquisas recentes a combinam com g\xEAmeos digitais para
    log\xEDstica urbana."
  _realWorldEn: Predictive maintenance is already common in railways, aviation and
    water networks, and recent research combines it with digital twins for urban
    logistics.
  _tradeOffs: "Exige sensores, dados hist\xF3ricos e equipe especializada, e alarmes
    falsos geram desconfian\xE7a."
  _tradeOffsEn: It requires sensors, historical data and specialized staff, and false
    alarms breed distrust.
  _sources:
  - Label: Predictive maintenance (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Predictive_maintenance
  - Label: Fatorachian et al. (2025), Smart Cities
    Url: https://doi.org/10.3390/smartcities8020056
